    "q-104893": {
      "dom_id": "step-q104893",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14262965/assets/8f0677c0a29729be721c0a7528377c646a222f5404c69ea8dc6ba941f70bc5f2.png)\n\nOn which of the following intervals is the function $y=f(x)$ above continuous?",
      "worked_solution": "The function is continuous on the open intervals  $(-3,0),$  $(0,1)$ and $(1,4).$\n\nAdditionally, the function is right-continuous at $x=-3$ and left-continuous at $x=0.$ \n\nTherefore, we can say that the function is continuous on the intervals $[-3,0],$  $(0,1)$ and $(1,4).$ It is also continuous on any subinterval of these intervals.\n\nAmong the answer choices, the correct one is the following:\n\n$\\,$ $[-2,-1]$ \n\nNotice that\n\n- $[1,2]$ and $[1,3]$ contain the endpoint $x=1,$ but the function is not right-continuous at this point.\n\n- $[-1,1]$ contains the point of discontinuity $x=0,$ so the function is not continuous on this interval.\n\n- $[2,4]$  contains the endpoint $x=4,$ but the function is not left-continuous at this point.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104893-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[1,3]",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104893-b",
